msgid "Notes: The quantity gamma is the minimum distance from the axis of lunar shadow cone to the center of Earth, in units of Earth’s equatorial radius. This distance is positive or negative, depending on whether the axis of the shadow cone passes north or south of the Earth's center. Path of solar eclipses during thousands of years in the past and future are not reliable due to uncertainty in ΔT which is caused by fluctuations in Earth's rotation."
msgstr "Notas: Die hoeveelheid gamma is die minimum afstand van die as van die maansakskadu-keël tot die middelpunt van Aarde, in eenhede van Aarde se ewenaarlike radius. Hierdie afstand is positief of negatief, afhangende daarvan of die as van die skadukegel noord of suid van Aarde se middelpunt verby gaan. Die pad van sonverduisteringe gedurende duisende jare in die verlede en toekoms is onbetroubaar weens onsekerheid in ΔT wat veroorsaak word deur skommelings in Aarde se rotasie."

msgid "Notes: The quantity gamma is the minimum distance from the center of the Moon to the axis of Earth’s umbral shadow cone, in units of Earth’s equatorial radius. This distance is positive or negative, depending on whether the Moon passes north or south of the shadow cone axis. Local circumstances for eclipses during thousands of years in the past and future are not reliable due to uncertainty in ΔT which is caused by fluctuations in Earth's rotation."
msgstr "Notas: Die hoeveelheid gamma is die minimum afstand van die middelpunt van die Maan tot die as van Aarde se umbra-skadukegel, in eenhede van Aarde se ewenaarlike radius. Hierdie afstand is positief of negatief, afhangende daarvan of die Maan noord of suid van die skadukegel-as verby gaan. Plaaslike omstandighede vir verduisteringe gedurende duisende jare in die verlede en toekoms is onbetroubaar weens onsekerheid in ΔT wat veroorsaak word deur skommelings in Aarde se rotasie."

msgid "Notes: Time in parentheses means the contact is invisible at current location. Transit times during thousands of years in the past and future are not reliable due to uncertainty in ΔT which is caused by fluctuations in Earth's rotation."
msgstr "Notas: Tyd in hakies beteken die kontak is onsigbaar op huidge ligging. Transiettye gedurende duisende jare in die verlede en toekoms is onbetroubaar weens onsekerheid in ΔT wat veroorsaak word deur skommelings in Aarde se rotasie."

